                  <a href="https://seo-project-21.vercel.app/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center px-4 py-2 border border-wood-accent text-wood-accent dark:text-wood-300 hover:bg-wood-50 dark:hover:bg-[#1a1a1a] text-xs font-semibold rounded-full transition-colors">Live Demo</a>
