              </div>
              <div class="mt-4">
                <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white group-hover:text-wood-accent transition-colors">
                  Tropang AI
                </h4>
                <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">
                  Turned large collections of company documents into a searchable AI knowledge base.
                </p>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-3">
                  <span class="font-semibold text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Built with:</span>
