                  <a href="https://github.com/property360-2/vibe" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center px-4 py-2 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 hover:border-gray-400 dark:hover:border-gray-500 hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-800 text-xs font-semibold rounded-full transition-colors">GitHub</a>
